  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Statistics</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Jordbruksstatistik Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SCB och Sida har nyligen tecknat ett ramavtal f&#xF6;r Balkan d&#xE4;r fortsatt st&#xF6;d till Kosovo rekommenderas inom omr&#xE5;det jordbruksstatistik. St&#xF6;d till Kosovos statistikmyndighet &#xE4;r en mycket viktig fr&#xE5;ga f&#xF6;r s&#xE5;v&#xE4;l UN mission in Kosovo (UNMIK) som &quot;Provisional Institutions for Self Government&quot; (PISG) och statistikmyndigheten har efterfr&#xE5;gat fortsatt st&#xF6;d fr&#xE5;n Sverige f&#xF6;r att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra sin kapacitet inom jordbruksstati</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Statistics Sweden and SIda has signes a regional agreement for cooperation in support to strengthening statistical capacities in the Balkans. In Kosovo statistics is prioritised by the UN mission in Kosovo UNMIK and the Provisional Institutions for Self Government PISG. The statistical office has requested continues support fron Sweden in the field.</narrative>
  </description>
